 "pvp_rule": "peaceful",
 "quests": [
  {
   "copper": 38,
   "description": "Basket-Poacher Thorn has found a way to sell every river basket twice, and somehow neither buyer gets supper. His Unlicensed Poachers trade after nightfall in the Whitebridge Oakwood southwest of Whitebridge Market Close; defeat five of them there at night. I have spent years earning this market's good name, and I will not let him sell that twice as well.",
   "giver": "r20_anchor_016_host",
   "giver_name": "Merren Oakstamp",
   "giver_settlement": "Whitebridge Market Close",
   "id": "whitebridge_baskets_01",
   "min_level": 21,
   "objectives": [
    "kill 5 unlicensed_poacher [in elandor_whitebridge_shire/oakwood]"
   ],
   "objectives_raw": [
    {
     "area": "elandor_whitebridge_shire/oakwood",
     "count": 5,
     "mobs": [
      "grug_mobs:unlicensed_poacher"
     ],
     "type": "kill"
    }
   ],
   "prerequisites": [],
   "reward_items": [],
   "title": "Sold Twice, Delivered Never",
   "turnin": "r20_anchor_016_host",
   "xp": 405
  },
  {
   "copper": 38,
   "description": "Before Murk built his ferry business, his relatives set up the Siltbasket Camp south from here, and they still charge carters for the privilege of being robbed. Defeat six Toll Mirefolk there, by day or night. Fight from the edge of the camp; they rush to help each other.",
   "giver": "r20_anchor_030_host",
   "giver_name": "Jessa Axlewright",
   "giver_settlement": "Oakspan Tollhouse",
   "id": "whitebridge_river_siltbasket",
   "min_level": 21,
   "objectives": [
    "kill 6 toll_mirefolk [in elandor_whitebridge_shire/siltbasket]"
   ],
   "objectives_raw": [
    {
     "area": "elandor_whitebridge_shire/siltbasket",
     "count": 6,
     "mobs": [
      "grug_mobs:toll_mirefolk"
     ],
     "type": "kill"
    }
   ],
   "prerequisites": [],
   "reward_items": [],
   "title": "Optional: The Siltbasket Toll",
   "turnin": "r20_anchor_030_host",
   "xp": 405
  },
  {
   "copper": 38,
   "description": "I sent the carts around Thorn's buyers, only to hear that Briarpack Wolves hunt the Whitebridge Meadows, in the southwest of Whitebridge Shire, at night. Defeat five there after dark so our drivers have a fighting chance. Hurt one and the pack comes running; work from the edge, with room to retreat.",
   "giver": "r20_anchor_016_host",
   "giver_name": "Merren Oakstamp",
   "giver_settlement": "Whitebridge Market Close",
   "id": "whitebridge_baskets_02",
   "min_level": 22,
   "objectives": [
    "kill 5 briarpack_wolf [in elandor_whitebridge_shire/meadows]"
   ],
   "objectives_raw": [
    {
     "area": "elandor_whitebridge_shire/meadows",
     "count": 5,
     "mobs": [
      "grug_mobs:briarpack_wolf"
     ],
     "type": "kill"
    }
   ],
   "prerequisites": [
    "whitebridge_baskets_01"
   ],
   "reward_items": [],
   "title": "The Pack at the Back Door",
   "turnin": "r20_anchor_016_host",
   "xp": 420
  },
  {
   "copper": 51,
   "description": "Basket-Poacher Thorn does his business in the Whitebridge Willowbanks south from here, day and night; apparently a man who sells everything twice needs the extra hours. Defeat him and report back to me. Ansel's kitchen paid for those baskets in good faith, and I mean to honour the order.",
   "giver": "r20_anchor_016_host",
   "giver_name": "Merren Oakstamp",
   "giver_settlement": "Whitebridge Market Close",
   "id": "whitebridge_baskets_03",
   "min_level": 23,
   "objectives": [
    "kill 1 basket_poacher_thorn"
   ],
   "objectives_raw": [
    {
     "count": 1,
     "mobs": [
      "grug_mobs:basket_poacher_thorn"
     ],
     "type": "kill"
    }
   ],
   "prerequisites": [
    "whitebridge_baskets_02"
   ],
   "reward_items": [],
   "title": "Thorn's Double Sale",
   "turnin": "r20_anchor_016_host",
   "xp": 580
  },
  {
   "copper": 26,
   "description": "My surveying brace shifted in the rain, and for one alarming moment my measurements gave the river a new address. Bring me six planks of any wood and six Steel Bars here at Bridgechalk Dig. Alloy iron with coal to make the steel, whenever your other work leaves time. I need the brace to stay put long enough to trust the next reading.",
   "giver": "r20_anchor_062_host",
   "giver_name": "Halen Chalkthumb",
   "giver_settlement": "Bridgechalk Dig",
   "id": "whitebridge_materials_01",
   "min_level": 23,
   "objectives": [
    "bring 6 group:wood",
    "bring 6 grug_materials:steel_bar"
   ],
   "objectives_raw": [
    {
     "count": 6,
     "group": "wood",
     "type": "item"
    },
    {
     "count": 6,
     "item": "grug_materials:steel_bar",
     "type": "item"
    }
   ],
   "prerequisites": [],
   "reward_items": [],
   "title": "A Measure That Stays Put",
   "turnin": "r20_anchor_062_host",
   "xp": 290
  },
  {
   "copper": 13,
   "description": "Some of Thorn's baskets were sold as Dwarven freight; I expect the buyers will have quite precise objections to his arithmetic. Visit Dorrin Gateledger in Dur Brannoc and explain the double sales. Of the three journeys I can offer, this one takes you to our Dwarven allies. Be clear about which merchant you mean when you say he cheated them.",
   "giver": "r20_anchor_016_host",
   "giver_name": "Merren Oakstamp",
   "giver_settlement": "Whitebridge Market Close",
   "id": "whitebridge_journey_dur_brannoc",
   "min_level": 24,
   "objectives": [
    "talk to Dorrin Gateledger (dur_brannoc)"
   ],
   "objectives_raw": [
    {
     "count": 1,
     "npc": "r20_dwarf_capital_envoy",
     "type": "talk"
    }
   ],
   "prerequisites": [
    "whitebridge_baskets_03"
   ],
   "reward_items": [],
   "title": "A Ledger for the Dwarves",
   "turnin": "r20_dwarf_capital_envoy",
   "xp": 145
  },
  {
   "copper": 13,
   "description": "Thorn's accounts reach as far as Tarnwatch Fold in Frostbarrow Shelf, which is an impressive distance for a basket nobody has received. Find Edda Tarnmantle there and tell her about his double sales. This is the coldest of the three journeys I can offer you. Pack warmly; I would like our explanation to arrive with all its fingers.",
   "giver": "r20_anchor_016_host",
   "giver_name": "Merren Oakstamp",
   "giver_settlement": "Whitebridge Market Close",
   "id": "whitebridge_journey_frostbarrow",
   "min_level": 24,
   "objectives": [
    "talk to Edda Tarnmantle (r20_anchor_014)"
   ],
   "objectives_raw": [
    {
     "count": 1,
     "npc": "r20_anchor_014_host",
     "type": "talk"
    }
   ],
   "prerequisites": [
    "whitebridge_baskets_03"
   ],
   "reward_items": [],
   "title": "Cold Storage",
   "turnin": "r20_anchor_014_host",
   "xp": 145
  },
  {
   "copper": 13,
   "description": "Thorn's accounts name Elven buyers too, and an Accord trading partner deserves to hear when somebody is spending her coin. Find Ilwen Petalmeasure at Lorindor Berrycourt in Lorindor and tell her what happened here. This is one of three journeys I can offer you, with more work likely at the other end. Give her my regards before you mention the baskets.",
   "giver": "r20_anchor_016_host",
   "giver_name": "Merren Oakstamp",
   "giver_settlement": "Whitebridge Market Close",
   "id": "whitebridge_journey_lorindor",
   "min_level": 24,
   "objectives": [
    "talk to Ilwen Petalmeasure (r20_anchor_018)"
   ],
   "objectives_raw": [
    {
     "count": 1,
     "npc": "r20_anchor_018_host",
     "type": "talk"
    }
   ],
   "prerequisites": [
    "whitebridge_baskets_03"
   ],
   "reward_items": [],
   "title": "The Other End of the River Trade",
   "turnin": "r20_anchor_018_host",
   "xp": 145
  },
  {
   "copper": 38,
   "description": "Bramble Bears from the Whitebridge Briarwood south of Bridgechalk Dig keep raiding our stores, and one of them has developed a taste for chalk-dusted biscuits. Bring down five by day. After dark the Briar-Web Spiders take that wood, and you are welcome to leave them to it.",
   "giver": "r20_anchor_062_host",
   "giver_name": "Halen Chalkthumb",
   "giver_settlement": "Bridgechalk Dig",
   "id": "whitebridge_materials_bears",
   "min_level": 25,
   "objectives": [
    "kill 5 territorial_bear [in elandor_whitebridge_shire/briarwood]"
   ],
   "objectives_raw": [
    {
     "area": "elandor_whitebridge_shire/briarwood",
     "count": 5,
     "mobs": [
      "grug_mobs:territorial_bear"
     ],
     "type": "kill"
    }
   ],
   "prerequisites": [],
   "reward_items": [],
   "title": "Optional: Bears in the Stores",
   "turnin": "r20_anchor_062_host",
   "xp": 465
  },
  {
   "copper": 38,
   "description": "Toll Mirefolk at the Whitebridge Ferry Camp west from here demand payment for every river basket, and Murk calls the whole business a ferry service. Defeat five of them, by day or night. They rush to help one another inside the camp, so fight from its edge. I can mend a cart, but I cannot keep mending our accounts after every crossing.",
   "giver": "r20_anchor_030_host",
   "giver_name": "Jessa Axlewright",
   "giver_settlement": "Oakspan Tollhouse",
   "id": "whitebridge_river_01",
   "min_level": 27,
   "objectives": [
